\newlabel{fig:introduction}{{1}{1}{Different from previous detection based methods that generally utilize a greedy strategy to choose the best proposal for segmentation, our spatiotemporal graph considers all proposals of each frame in the spatial domain and utilizes historic masks for refinement in the temporal domain, which provides better mask details.}{}{}}
